## What is cash management?
Cash Management is an option your adviser can switch on for paying the Aviva, adviser, Aviva commercial property and Discretionary Investment Model charges. Your adviser will assess whether it's suitable for you based on the level of trading flexibility they require on your account. See 'What are the charges for your Pension Portfolio?' for more details.
