## As you approach retirement…
If you're invested in one of The People's Pension's investment profiles, The People's Pension gradually starts to switch the investment of your savings 15 years before your selected retirement age. This is to more secure/lower risk investments (known as a 'glidepath' - you can visit www.thepeoplespension.co.uk/your-retirement-options to read more about this). It aims to limit any falls in the value of your pension savings just before you retire, but could also result in lower growth.
If you choose to self-select, this option doesn't include a glidepath. You'll be responsible for managing how much you invest in each of your selected funds. You may want to consider reviewing both your fund selection and your attitude to investment risk regularly.
