If We determine that Your Investment Pathway Fund is no longer appropriate for the Investment Pathway objective, We may decide to close the existing Fund and add a replacement Fund to Your Pension Portfolio. You agree that We may transfer Your money out of the old Investment Pathway Fund and into the new Investment Pathway Fund. We will notify You of any changes as soon as practically possible, which may be after the transfer has taken place.
