## What this means to you:

- 1) The value we transfer may be different to the amount shown in any quote we may have given you.
- 2) When all the money in your pension plan is transferred to your new provider we won't be responsible for paying you any more money from that plan.
- 3) When part of the money in your pension plan is transferred to your new provider we'll only be responsible for the money that's been left in your Aviva plan. We won't be responsible for the amount we've transferred to your new provider.
- 4) Even if we transfer some or all of the money in your plan to a new provider, we'll still be responsible if we later find we've made a mistake with your plan.

